Package: riprvis
Title: Interactive Visualisations for Reverse Information Projections
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Floyd", "Everest", , "me@floydeverest.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interactive 'htmlwidgets' and static base-graphics
    visualisations of reverse information projection (RIPr) fits and their
    branch-and-bound certification, as computed by the 'ripr' package, for
    three-category multinomial families on the simplex and two-dimensional
    Gaussian families on the plane. Each view (the problem, the fit, the
    certification, and a comparison of runs) has a widget verb and a static
    plot verb, both drawing from a plain-list payload, so saved results draw
    without 'ripr' installed.
